197.8098 	EXP 	unnamed TextStim: text = 'Part 1 of 3: colour calibration (48 trials)\n\nOn each trial you will first see two coloured squares and hear two speech sounds. Try to remember them. Then one colour will appear together with one sound.\n\nDid this colour AND this sound both appear a moment ago?\n   Y = yes, both of them did.      N = no, at least one of them is different.\n\nFirst, 10 practice trials with feedback. Then 48 trials without feedback.\n\nPlease press Y or N on EVERY trial, even when you are not sure. A trial without a response cannot be used.\n\nPress the space bar to begin.'
